{"time": 1770707398, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1739803746", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "929378827", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "没活，去社团吧"}
{"time": 1770708258, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1083015748", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "929378827", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "下课后，或者说放学后的氛围总是轻松愉快，归家部，社团活动，总归带着些雀跃。你来到操场旁的弓道社，人并不多，场地也不大，寥寥几个靶子，几个社员同你打招呼，\"下午好，巫山前辈。\""}
{"time": 1770708481, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2024788660", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "929378827", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“下午好，学弟学妹们来得真早”打完招呼，先去更衣，随后来到靶场“……我们班今天来了个转学生”"}
{"time": 1770708966, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1590831361", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "929378827", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我想想人名)"}
{"time": 1770708985, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1592975940", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "929378827", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你说间桐我也不会意外的）"}
{"time": 1770709348, "type": "recv", "message_id": "17042598", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "929378827", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“诶？转学生？我记得前辈不是高三吗？”平日里和你走得挺近的后辈，天宫秋凑到你旁边，递给你一把木弓。"}
{"time": 1770709507, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1753421211", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "929378827", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“谢谢”接过弓“嗯，不知道怎么这个时候过来……我只想平平淡淡毕业啊”"}
{"time": 1770709887, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1362196371", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "929378827", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "秋伸手绑起自己的头发，扎成一个马尾，“诶？就算有转学生，也没什么差别吧？前辈在担心什么？”"}
{"time": 1770709962, "type": "recv", "message_id": "228366651", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "929378827", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“学校里和班里的规矩什么的”*张弓搭箭“这个时间点入校的话……”"}
{"time": 1770709971, "type": "recv", "message_id": "312085901", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "929378827", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "。ra弓箭"}
