{"time": 1770713146, "type": "recv", "message_id": "655526947", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "929378827", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“又射歪了诶？”秋眨了眨眼，“嗯...但是我听说一旦开始就走不出去了诶...”"}
{"time": 1770713401, "type": "recv", "message_id": "718548728", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "929378827", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（何意味）"}
{"time": 1770713480, "type": "recv", "message_id": "766982295", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "929378827", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“不过只是听说啦，也有人说，根本就不存在这种事情，大家都是庸人自扰。嗯...也有人说只要好好上柱香，就什么都不会发生。”秋继续开口，“毕竟，我们也没有亲眼见过啦、”"}
{"time": 1770713778, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1083796277", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "929378827", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“真的假的……离不开吗？我不想冒那个险啦”叹了口气，放下弓“不过没听说过有停下的办法，我是希望不要开始……虽然有点残酷”"}
{"time": 1770714135, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1808877556", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "929378827", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“残酷？”"}
